# frames 30 every 30
# Dusk coming (pk03): the run starts 750 rows up the path (the replay
# header's `start`), a quarter of the way from DUSK_START (600) to
# DUSK_FULL (1200): the palette is a blend of the afternoon's and the
# dusk's keyframes, quantized to the 256-colour cube (the path a step
# darker, the canopy already dusk's), the red eyes unchanged. The plain
# tier is still the afternoon's (it steps at the midpoint).
pk 1
seed 11
tier rich
size 80x24
start 750
